# type(scope): short description
#
# Types (choose one):
#   fix      - bug fix             → patch release
#   feat     - new feature         → minor release
#   feat!    - breaking change     → major release
#   chore    - maintenance/tooling → no release
#   docs     - documentation       → no release
#   refactor - restructure code    → no release
#   test     - add/update tests    → no release
#   style    - formatting only     → no release
#   perf     - performance         → patch release
#   ci       - CI/CD changes       → no release
#   build    - build system        → no release
#
# scope is optional: fix(sdjwt): ...
#
# Breaking change — add ! or a BREAKING CHANGE footer:
#   feat!: remove deprecated API
#
#   BREAKING CHANGE: description of what broke and migration path
#
# Closes #<issue>
